  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在靴子上包裹羊毛，防止被幽匿體與監守者偵測。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;完全相容官方 1.19+ 版本的監守者！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>覺得這雙靴子讓深暗之域太簡單？下載「監守者漫步」以獲得更平衡的體驗：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/warden-walkers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#36f;text-decoration:underline\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/warden-walkers</span></span></a></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\">此靴子能消除</span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\">以下震動：</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#339\">- 行走踏步</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#339;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 掉落並著地</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#339;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 投擲投射物（投射物擊中目標仍會被偵測，但震動源將追溯至投射物而非玩家本人）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">材質等級：</span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#930\">皮革 |</span> <span style=\"color:#808080\">鏈甲 |</span></strong> <strong>鐵<span style=\"color:#333\"> |</span> <span style=\"color:#f90\">黃金 |</span> <span style=\"color:#0cf\">鑽石 |</span> <span style=\"color:#000\">下界合金</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/471/230/2022-06-23_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"447\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:24px;text-align:left\">羊毛靴實機演示</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px;text-align:left\">羊毛靴展示片段從 1:29 開始</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RF9UrxMB-UQ?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/uOxwtL4bgzc?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">支援版本快速連結（Forge 與 Fabric）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wooled-boots/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:73242\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://images2.imgbox.com/78/a3/hJmGtYU1_o.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"147\" height=\"52\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wooled-boots/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:73250\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://images2.imgbox.com/1a/82/aG7TBn8s_o.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"147\" height=\"52\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wooled-boots/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:73407\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://images2.imgbox.com/02/f2/CYMccLoe_o.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"147\" height=\"52\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>與朋友一起遊玩本模組！使用優惠碼「jackbusters」可享 Minecraft 伺服器主機 25% 折扣。</strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fjackbusters%253fr%253dWooled%2bBoots\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/ba99da02-fd57-4ccc-89a5-9a5bba0922d2.webp\" alt=\"Get 25% off Minecraft Server Hosting\" width=\"900\" height=\"150\"></a></h3>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">監守者模組相容性</span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#339;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">部分新增監守者的模組已與羊毛靴相容。這些模組包括：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-wild-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#036\">- 荒野模組（The Wild Mod），由 lukebattle04（及 FrozenBlock 模組開發團隊）製作</span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px;color:#000;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">靴子模組相容性</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#036;text-decoration:underline\">- 通用機械工具（Mekanism Tools）[Forge]</span></span></strong></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#036;text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/copper-equipment-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">- 銅裝備（Copper Equipment）[Fabric]</a> </span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/therrassium\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#036;text-decoration:underline\">- Therrassium [Fabric]</span></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">整合包政策</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color:#339\">您有權將此模組自由收錄於任何託管於 CurseForge 上的整合包中。</span></p>",
